OL,3,GNEWSAChildren with a parent on benefits
OL,4,Ano longer eligible for priority
OL,5,Apre-school place
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, critics have said the rules
OL,8,Fmade sure vulnerable children got "a
OL,9,Ffoot up the ladder", while political
OL,10,Frepresentatives from Sinn Fein,
OL,11,FAlliance and the SDLP questioned the
OL,12,Fplans at Stormont on Monday.
